---
title: Notification Service Flow
---
flowchart TD
  U([User]) --> P["Header bell + NotificationsProvider"]
  P --> H["useNotificationsContext"]
  H --> Q["React Query cache<br/>(keys, refetch, invalidate)"]
  Q --> A["notificationApi"]
  A --> C["apiClient (Axios)<br/>token injection - 401 refresh - 403 role refresh"]
  C --> S[("VITE_NOTIFICATION_SERVICE_URL")]
  S --> C --> Q --> P
  subgraph UI[Page interactions]
    S0["Poll / receive notifications"]
    S1["Unread badge count"]
    S2["Mark read / mark all read"]
    S3["Deep link to related request"]
  end
  P --> UI
  C -. error .-> E["ApiErrorBoundary + toast"]
